The function is already a single comparison; I added a branch-prediction hint so call sites lay out the common "valid" path as fall-through, which is the only remaining lever for such a trivial inline-candidate getter.

```cpp
FIT_BOOL Field::IsValid(void) const
{
    return __builtin_expect(profileIndex != FIT_UINT16_INVALID, 1);
}
```
